abstract: >-
  Latent diffusion over frozen protein language model representations
  with a post-generation selection stage, trained and evaluated on a
  single 24 GB consumer GPU. Ablations across encoder capacity, noise
  schedule, training duration, auxiliary objectives, selection rules
  and three training corpora of differing redundancy.
